      "subject": "יחטאו \/ יחטא",
      "rationale": "Daɲɛ fila min bɛ kɛ ka bɔ daɲɛ kelen na, a bɛ jira ko jurumu ye hadamaden ka sariya ye — Bamanankan na o tɛ dɔn a cogo kelen na"
